1) ECAPA-TDNN speaker embedder (model/ecapa-speaker-v1.onnx,
   fbank-80x201-f32.bin)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source: vedk00/ecapa-voxceleb-speaker-embedding-onnx (Apache-2.0 packaging),
pinned at HF commit a9cb9321b07b4ee5b0ea47fdd25242d9cacd824a; ONNX export of
speechbrain/spkrec-ecapa-voxceleb (SpeechBrain, Apache-2.0).

The embedder weights are trained on the VoxCeleb dataset, so redistribution
carries the dataset's CC BY 4.0 attribution, which applies to models trained
on it. Required attribution text:

    Speaker embeddings in this module are computed with an ECAPA-TDNN model
    (256-channel, 192-d output) trained on the VoxCeleb dataset
    (https://www.robots.ox.ac.uk/~vgg/data/voxceleb/).

    Creator: Joon Son Chung, Arsha Nagrani and Andrew Zisserman.
    VoxCeleb is released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
    (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
    Modifications: converted to ONNX with a frozen SpeechBrain-compatible
    80-band filterbank (fbank-80x201-f32.bin); preprocessing contract in models/manifest.json.

Note: the 83.5 MiB model file itself is NOT committed (exceeds the repo
large-file guard); it is fetched at runtime and SHA-256-verified (SRI, W3C
pattern) before an inference session is created. The filterbank IS committed.

